{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/about_WelcomeToVaifurion_2.png?t=1750180368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cozy blend of idle progression, card collecting, and RPG mechanics. Click, collect, and unlock over <strong>1,000</strong> beautifully illustrated waifu cards, some with stunning holographic effects, while enjoying a <strong>chill</strong>, <strong>ambient experience</strong>. Explore the world of Vaifurion \u2014 a realm shaped by flame, frost, shadow, and light \u2014 where the resurfacing of the mythical Eclipse Crown has set countless heroines on a path toward power, purpose, or ruin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/about_Game_Features.png?t=1750180368\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1,000+ Collectible Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Holographic effects, multiple rarities, and full collection tracking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Idle &amp; Active Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click your way to progress, or let the game unfold automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lootbox System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open Basic, Mystic, Celestial, and Ethereal lootboxes to uncover cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable Gallery &amp; Videos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/videoloop_description_1.gif?t=1750180368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For both casual collectors and completionists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing &amp; Stylish UI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy smooth animations, ambient effects, and a cozy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>60+ Custom Music Tracks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To set a certain mood and tone to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/about__world.png?t=1750180368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Across its continents, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>many distinct races</strong>, each with their own culture, powers, and secrets. From the radiant <strong>Sunchosen</strong> and enigmatic <strong>Netherbinders</strong>, to the playful <strong>Slimekin</strong> and fierce <strong>Flame Succubi</strong>, every card you collect tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore <strong>unique regions</strong>, from the volcanic <strong>Ashen Peaks</strong> to the twilight-cloaked <strong>Nightspire Hollow</strong>, the glowing <strong>Emerald Vale</strong>, and storm-ravaged <strong>Tempest Isles</strong>. Each area pulses with elemental energy and mystery \u2014 and all are connected by whispers of the <strong>Eclipse Crown</strong>, a forgotten relic that could reshape the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/1000cards_v5.gif?t=1750180368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2756 <strong>Wishlist now and prepare for the ultimate card-collecting adventure!\u00a0</strong>\u2756</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3563130?t=1750180368","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/2a70ee1846a20de6d2ee90fc9ca67a23cb99b893/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750180368","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/63d28619de1ba662307a083b3b19af44eacc6fe8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750180368","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/63d28619de1ba662307a083b3b19af44eacc6fe8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750180368","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Vaifurion contains fantasy artwork of female characters wearing revealing outfits and suggestive poses. There is no nudity or explicit sexual content in the base game. Some characters are designed with mature themes (e.g., succubi race), and visual fanservice is part of the collectible experience."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/about_WelcomeToVaifurion_2.png?t=1750180368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cozy blend of idle progression, card collecting, and RPG mechanics. Click, collect, and unlock over <strong>1,000</strong> beautifully illustrated waifu cards, some with stunning holographic effects, while enjoying a <strong>chill</strong>, <strong>ambient experience</strong>. Explore the world of Vaifurion \u2014 a realm shaped by flame, frost, shadow, and light \u2014 where the resurfacing of the mythical Eclipse Crown has set countless heroines on a path toward power, purpose, or ruin.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/about_Game_Features.png?t=1750180368\" /></div></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>1,000+ Collectible Cards</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Holographic effects, multiple rarities, and full collection tracking.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Idle &amp; Active Gameplay</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Click your way to progress, or let the game unfold automatically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Lootbox System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open Basic, Mystic, Celestial, and Ethereal lootboxes to uncover cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Unlockable Gallery &amp; Videos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/videoloop_description_1.gif?t=1750180368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ Achievements</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For both casual collectors and completionists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxing &amp; Stylish UI</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy smooth animations, ambient effects, and a cozy atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>60+ Custom Music Tracks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To set a certain mood and tone to the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/about__world.png?t=1750180368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Across its continents, you\u2019ll encounter <strong>many distinct races</strong>, each with their own culture, powers, and secrets. From the radiant <strong>Sunchosen</strong> and enigmatic <strong>Netherbinders</strong>, to the playful <strong>Slimekin</strong> and fierce <strong>Flame Succubi</strong>, every card you collect tells a story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore <strong>unique regions</strong>, from the volcanic <strong>Ashen Peaks</strong> to the twilight-cloaked <strong>Nightspire Hollow</strong>, the glowing <strong>Emerald Vale</strong>, and storm-ravaged <strong>Tempest Isles</strong>. Each area pulses with elemental energy and mystery \u2014 and all are connected by whispers of the <strong>Eclipse Crown</strong>, a forgotten relic that could reshape the world itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/extras/1000cards_v5.gif?t=1750180368\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2756 <strong>Wishlist now and prepare for the ultimate card-collecting adventure!\u00a0</strong>\u2756</p>","developers":["Nightspire Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3563130/fd31cd20a9856b38cf691604cfcbb62c27bf033a/header.jpg?t=1750180368","is_free":true,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Nightspire Games. All rights reserved. Vaifurion\u2122 and all related content are trademarks of Nightspire Games.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Vaifurion \u2013 Idle Waifu CCG","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated GPU (Intel HD or better)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 6 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5 or Ryzen 5+<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Dedicated GPU for smoother animations<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Nightspire Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Nudez","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Sexuelle Andeutungen","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam